[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the car on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584310\">1088D10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the rigid engine oil vapour recirculation\npipe.</p><p>2. Loosen the band and disconnect the engine oil vapour recirculation\npipe from the rigid pipe.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065753.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the engine coolant\ntemperature sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Data not available yet</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo and remove the engine coolant temperature sensor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021803.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the engine coolant\ntemperature sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Data not available yet</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo and remove the engine coolant temperature sensor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065754.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the engine coolant temperature sensor\nback in its housing and tighten it to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>ENGINE COOLANT TEMPERATURE SENSOR.</p></td><td><p>M12</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Thermostat side) 1.8 ÷ 2.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nengine coolant temperature sensor.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the engine coolant temperature sensor\nback in its housing and tighten it to the recommended torque.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Restore the sealant on the sensor\nthread.</p></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>ENGINE COOLANT TEMPERATURE SENSOR.</p></td><td><p>M16</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Thermostat side) 3.1 ÷ 3.7</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nengine coolant temperature sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Data not available yet</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the engine oil vapour recirculation\nhose to the rigid pipe and tighten the band.</p><p>Tighten the bolts securing the engine oil\nvapour recirculation rigid pipe.</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the lower coolant outlet hose from\nthe radiator, radiator side, and tighten the band.</p><p>Refill the engine cooling system with coolant \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2584122\">0010T20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584310\">1088D10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]